 sorts of cardinality at\0A                         most N (-1 == no limit, default)\0A  --uf-ss-fair           use fair strategy for finite model finding multiple\0A                         sorts [*]\0A  --uf-ss-fair-monotone  group monotone sorts when enforcing fairness for finite\0A                         model finding (EXPERTS only) [*]\0A\00", align 1
